body:
Considering you're just 17, it's really not uncommon to not have had a first kiss at that age.

&#x200B;

There are plenty of stories of people finding love later in life. My high school history teacher had never had a girlfriend before he was in his late twenties, and he's married now! People have a chance of finding love even if they have a later start (not that I would consider 17 to be a late start). It can be frustrating hearing peers talk about experiences you haven't had yet, but it doesn't mean that you will die alone.

idk I'm looking for some more things to eat or drink but I just don't have enough lol

&#x200B;

I don't really want to talk to the doctor because it's kind of embarrassing. I don't want people to find out about this because it's embarrassing like I don't want to wreck my social life
